    <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
    <tr>
        <td id="descriptionArea">
            <ol>
	<li><b>Social icons in menu not matching design</b></li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b>
	<ol>
		<li>Open the menu and check the social media icons.</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li><b>Actual Result:</b> Social icons are <b>not in the same order</b> as in the design. The <b>Facebook and LinkedIn icons do not match</b> the design.</li>
	<li><b>Expected Result:</b> Social icons should be in the correct order, and should visually match the design specifications.</li>
	<li><b>Screenshots - actual vs expected</b><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10002" alt="Pasted Graphic 3-20250929-213606.png" width="277" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10011" alt="Pasted Graphic 4-20250929-213645.png" width="275" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ul>



<hr />

<ol>
	<li><b>“Our Services” option inconsistent across web and mobile</b></li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b>
	<ol>
		<li>Open the website menu on desktop and mobile.</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li><b>Actual Result:</b> On desktop/web, <em>“Our Services”</em> is displayed in the menu, but according to design it should only appear on mobile.</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10003" alt="CDA-20250930-162635.png" width="383" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<ul>
	<li><b>Expected Result:</b> <em>“Our Services”</em> menu option should only appear on mobile, as specified in the design.</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10007" alt="All Services-20250930-162716.png" width="413" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<hr />

<ol>
	<li><b>Mobile layout issues with title, text, and buttons</b></li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b>
	<ol>
		<li>Open the mobile version of the page.</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li><b>Actual Result:</b>
	<ul>
		<li><b>Title too large</b> compared to the design.</li>
		<li>Description text (lorem ipsum…) is shown <b>under the image</b> instead of <b>under the title.</b></li>
		<li><b>Placeholder text</b> is not replaced with real content.</li>
		<li><em>“Start a project”</em> and <em>“View our services”</em> buttons are displayed <b>one below the other.</b></li>
		<li>The <b>arrow</b> next to <em>“Start a project”</em> is <b>too small</b> and below the Start a project text.</li>
		<li><b>Underline</b> below <em>“Start a project”</em> - line too long, too much space between line and Start a project.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10005" alt="welcome to-20250930-165500.tiff" width="321" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
<ul>
	<li><b>Expected Result:</b>
	<ul>
		<li>Smaller title</li>
		<li><b>Text below the title</b>, not below the image.</li>
		<li>Real content should replace placeholder text.</li>
		<li><b>Buttons</b> should be displayed <b>side by side.</b></li>
		<li><b>Arrow and underline</b> should match the design below:</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10010" alt="Title That Links To-20250930-165707.png" width="353" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<hr />

<ol>
	<li><b>Mobile header and burger menu text issues</b></li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b>
	<ol>
		<li>Open the mobile burger menu.</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li><b>Actual Result:</b>
	<ul>
		<li>CDA <b>text is too large</b>; All texts in the burger menu are too large.</li>
		<li><b>There is a line</b> between CDA text and <em>“Our Services”</em>.</li>
		<li><b>Arrow</b> next to <em>“Our Services”</em> is missing its tail, only the arrowhead is visible.</li>
		<li><b>Line</b> under <em>“Our Services”</em> is not visible as in the design (too grey let’s say; more white)</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><b>Expected Result:</b>
	<ul>
		<li><b>Smaller texts</b> - CDA text and burger menu texts - should match design sizes.</li>
		<li><b>No line</b> should appear between CDA text and <em>“Our Services”</em>.</li>
		<li><b>Arrow</b> should be complete.</li>
		<li><b>Line</b> under <em>“Our Services”</em> - color #DBDBDB</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li>Expected vs actual :</li>
	<li><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10009" alt="Pasted Graphic 9-20250930-173815.png" width="655" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span><br/>
<span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10036" alt="image-20251001-094954.png" width="884" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></li>
</ul>



<hr />

<ol>
	<li><b>Mobile “Back” option issues</b></li>
</ol>


<ul>
	<li><b>Steps to Reproduce:</b>
	<ol>
		<li>Open the mobile burger menu and navigate to a submenu with the <em>“Back”</em> option.</li>
	</ol>
	</li>
	<li><b>Actual Result:</b>
	<ul>
		<li>The Back button shows an <b>arrow pointing left/forward.</b></li>
		<li><em>“</em><b><em>Back”</em></b> <b>underline not visible</b> - same issue as in bug above.</li>
		<li><b>There is a line</b> between CDA and <em>“Back”</em>.</li>
		<li>The label for back button should be underlined.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
	<li><b>Expected Result:</b>
	<ul>
		<li>The Back button should display an <b>arrow pointing downwards.</b></li>
		<li>There should be <b>no line between CDA and</b> <b><em>“Back”</em></b><b>.</b></li>
		<li>Line under <em>“Back”</em> should be more visible, “more white”  - color #DBDBDB</li>
		<li>The label for the back button is not underlined.</li>
	</ul>
	</li>
</ul>


<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10006" alt="image-20250930-181526.png" width="655" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>

<p><span class="image-wrap" style=""><img src="/rest/api/3/attachment/content/10037" alt="image-20251001-095744.png" width="908" style="border: 0px solid black" /></span></p>
            <br/>
